{"slug":"OP-NINJA-SIMULATOR-Bug-fix-30645","_id":"67c3e491a5b8d1fcc924ba6d","title":"Bug fix","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77e06","gameId":4225025295,"name":"[SOON] OP NINJA⚡","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-cf713ab1fecf4a1bb795f762dbd1b0a5-d7d47bad7dbd.png","placeId":4225025295},"features":"I do not know what it is, but when I run the service through an index like \"game.Players\" then it returns a random service, which is why many scripts didn't work, but they worked through GetService, so I decided to fix it with this script and share with you","tags":[],"script":"local success = pcall(function() return game.Players.LocalPlayer end)\n if not success then\n  substitute = hookmetamethod(game, \"__index\", newcclosure(function(self, prop)\n if self == game and game:FindFirstChild(tostring(prop)) then\nreturn game:GetService(tostring(prop)) end\n  return substitute(self, prop)\n   end))\n end","owner":{"_id":"657de6ff3fc064145583e6bb","username":"ADSKer","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/657de6ff3fc064145583e6bb-1711768867821.jpg","status":"offline","id":"657de6ff3fc064145583e6bb","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"week","rank":17,"period":"week","metric":"likes","value":3}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":50}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":8363,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2025-03-02T04:54:41.740Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":2,"image":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c7336310435b903e034bc2f31b80f17d/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","executes":759,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e7b360710ec3c55424","editBy":{"_id":"657de6ff3fc064145583e6bb","username":"ADSKer","status":"offline","id":"657de6ff3fc064145583e6bb"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T22:53:25.376Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6a8290c7849d792438cc7b64","commentBy":{"_id":"67759801927ffd3c95c6084d","username":"sherwinam500","verified